y. The page reads the active profile’s finished downloads off the device and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names them from the metadata each one already carries, so it needs no list of candidates and no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network — it draws the same in a tunnel as on Wi-Fi. Anything still queued, downloading, paused","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or failed is left out, and a download that completes while the page is open appears on its own.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The column count follows the width the page is offered, so the same call fits an iPhone and an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iPad in either orientation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Most recently downloaded first: a reader who has just taken an issue offline looks for it at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the top, whatever its release date says.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The page lays out in the host’s scroll context and owns no navigation bar, so place it inside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whatever chrome the app already has.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["CGS.UI.libraryPage(","    actions: .init(onSelectIssue: { issue in \/* open the reader *\/ })",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Selecting several issues","anchor":"Selecting-several-issues"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Passing a ","type":"text"},{"code":"selection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" binding puts the page in selection mode: every cell draws a checkbox and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a tap adds or removes that issue instead of calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"onSelectIssue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the default —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to leave taps opening issues. An edit-mode toggle is therefore a binding the host swaps in and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"out, with no separate flag to keep in step:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@State private var isEditing = false","@State private var selected: Set<CGS.Data.Issue.Short.Identifier> = []","","CGS.UI.libraryPage(","    actions: .init(onSelectIssue: { issue in \/* open the reader *\/ }),","    selection: self.isEditing ? self.$selected : nil",")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Acting on the selection — deleting the downloads, and the button that does it — belongs to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"host, which owns the navigation bar the page deliberately does not.","type":"text"}]}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/cgsui\/cgs\/ui\/librarypage(actions:selection:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11libraryPage7actions9selectionQrAF07LibraryF0O7ActionsV_05SwiftD07BindingVyShyAC4DataO5IssueO10IdentifierVGGSgtFZ","extendedModule":"CGSUI","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"libraryPage","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"actions","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO","text":"CGS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO","text":"UI","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO","text":"LibraryPage","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7CGSData3CGSO5CGSUIE2UIO11LibraryPageO7ActionsV","text":"Actions","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"selection","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","k